OL,3,GNEWSACity play sessions help children
OL,4,Aget 'school ready'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies in Peterborough are being
OL,7,Finvited to free baby and toddler groups
OL,8,Fas part of bid to ensure children are
OL,9,F"school ready".
OL,11,FThe city council is spending #35,000 on
OL,12,Fplaygroups and online resources to help
OL,13,Fmore children become developmentally
OL,14,Fprepared for the classroom.
OL,16,FLeader Shabina Asad Qayyum said: "We
OL,17,Fhave seen a generation of young
OL,18,Fchildren, babies up until toddler age
OL,19,Fwho were just not prepared for school,"
OL,20,Fadding that some were "still in
OL,21,Fnappies".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
