OL,3,GNEWSACity play sessions help children
OL,4,Aget 'school ready'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast year, 65% of children in
OL,7,FPeterborough reached a good level of
OL,8,Fdevelopment by the end of the Reception
OL,9,Fyear, compared with 67.7% nationally.
